<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuelan forces are reported to have bombed an ELN camp near the Colombia border, killing at least 19, while a drone strike allegedly destroyed an ELN drug depot in the same area, causing at least 20 deaths. Opposition leader María Corina Machado returned to Venezuela and called for elections, delivering her first address since her return. President Trump has referenced the Maduro capture operation while discussing Cuba and suggested possible U.S. action against Cuba, and he claimed Venezuelan oil revenues far exceed Iran war costs. Chevron is expanding operations in Venezuela as Exxon urges caution. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQR0dDTGhibEdSSDFoZlVLY19IeTY0eWtHUDdFc3lUWHRTZG9mMlNidzhBUkwtOXhwcDFVYVVLazdBb0gyOFo5VjZvU3U4RTJ0amRnRFU5TFFQZGhaeFVLazJFSTdhOFZGUUhmZFoxQ2FMQVRhVzQxOXlESUVIZnFnV0t0T3RaQTJOY3d3anZnSlUwUjRwVy1na0xpbnVjMkot?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE53VTRXS3QydjdlOUczTkNnclhxak15dGRHQnA2RGV1cFhjcHlRclVLYUtuMzNhYnFGYlFkdXhmaGRkYTR2ZXFyZjFqZzBzY1ZTNFFuLUoydlVVUHd1RVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE5YWjF5c3pEY1FzMTF4VjVTdU40QUl0MlhwTUg4YlMxR1hsSm0xQ3dYY1hwNXBVOHVHREhRMngtNGpfeVRLY2ZhQndzd2ZBSDl0a0ZoM2NGd2I5bW5OVnhqRW1uQzhsWTJkdlZqMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOOW4xQlNPNWwtaGlBdC0zcnp4b29Ucjl3eTdKd0NlanB6T1lDUngwM09aUzV5Y1pTS2pIVzRUNVZnMzllYnFZZ3dlN09SRTFJeTAzaHU5XzlTWllNTElxM29xZWVKMlFMSTk2eUd0dkhoZlVWbXJ3Y0ZUallHU2UtU2ZQd2tzVC02S2RRRGNZUzFEVmE5YUFqX2NZYlpmbHI3a1dGaGhha0hzQ3lkbktSR0tqV3kwUEE?oc=5&quot